    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d480">

                <pb facs="0541" n="525" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg525"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.34/6–1047: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-06-10T14:00:00-04:00">June 10, 1947—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>461. 1. Military Air Attaché approached Chilean authorities re possible
                    acquisition vessels mentioned Depgam 177 May 7. Chileans interested but unable
                    discuss details at moment (Deptel 266 June 4<anchor n="44" xml:id="d480-f1"
                    />).</p>
                <p>2. Chief Naval Mission<anchor n="45" xml:id="d480-f2"/> states vessels are
                    scattered along Chilean coast and strongly recommends their remaining Chilean
                    custody pending negotiations; mission lacks funds or personnel properly
                    safeguard vessels if possession taken.</p>
                <p>3. Embassy reluctant press negotiations re vessels pending completion
                    arrangements sale aircraft mentioned Embtel 403 May 26.<anchor n="46"
                        xml:id="d480-f3"/> Please advise status aircraft deal and expedite
                    instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
